ExpansionHunter variant catalog (Illumina, Inc.)
------------------------------------------------
src/genokeeper/resources/repeats/stage3a.GRCh38.json is cut from Illumina's ExpansionHunter
GRCh38 variant catalog at tag v5.0.0 (variant_catalog/grch38/variant_catalog.json,
https://github.com/Illumina/ExpansionHunter), Copyright (c) 2016 Illumina, Inc., under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 at that tag. Modified: the repeat loci's entries and RFC1's
kept, their OfftargetRegions removed and their contigs renamed, PABPN1's replaced, RFC1's
motif analysis turned on, and entries for ZFHX3, THAP11, FGF14 and CFTR added
(src/genokeeper/resources/repeats/SOURCE.md).


STRchive v2.28.0
----------------
The repeat thresholds in config/grading.toml ([repeat_loci]: the normal, intermediate,
reduced-penetrance and pathogenic bounds and the evidence level) are taken from STRchive
v2.28.0's STRchive-loci.json, with the changes stated there (HTT's pathogenic minimum,
ATXN10's intermediate maximum). The regions of PABPN1, ZFHX3, THAP11 and FGF14 in
src/genokeeper/resources/repeats/added.GRCh38.json are taken from STRchive v2.28.0's
ExpansionHunter catalog (STRchive-disease-loci-v2.28.0.hg38.expansionhunter.json), modified:
trimmed to whole repeat units and renamed (src/genokeeper/resources/repeats/SOURCE.md).
STRchive (https://strchive.org) by Harriet Dashnow is licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/); its repository
(https://github.com/dashnowlab/STRchive) is under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Harriet
Dashnow. Please cite:

  Hiatt L, Weisburd B, Dolzhenko E, Rubinetti V, Avvaru AK, VanNoy GE, Kurtas NE, Rehm HL,
