ClinGen
-------
tests/fixtures/check_responses/clingen.body, clingen_dosage.body and cspec.body are responses
recorded from the Clinical Genome Resource's public endpoints on 2026-10-27. ClinGen releases
its curations under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/) and asks
that they be attributed to ClinGen (https://clinicalgenome.org).


